= What I actually believe <ch-belief>

The earlier chapters kept four things apart: what is true of any economy, what follows by logic from the premise, what I suppose on evidence and at stated odds, and what is a forecast. This chapter brings them together. The guide was commissioned to end with my best guess and my real belief. Here it is, stated as plainly as I can, with the confidence I actually have. @fig-probabilities shows how I divide my belief among the six scenarios.

